      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova wamazaza denjili kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Namutiyili Ziyona mukawu wasweja, namutiyili mukawu wakulendumuka nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Ami nafunti dehi kuZiyona, nukushakamaŋa muYerusalema. NiYerusalema akawutenaŋa, nawu mukala wansaŋu yalala, nimpidi yaYehova wamazaza akayitenaŋa, nawu mpidi yajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, MuYerusalema mwakashakama cheŋi tushinakaji twamayala nitwawambanda, wejima wawu nanyikombu yawu kumakasa nakukula kwanakuluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyikwakwa yamumukala mwakenzala anyana amayala nawambanda nakuhemena munyikwakwa yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Hela neyi chikwikala chuma chakuhayama kumesu awantu awa anashaluku mafuku awa, chiikali chuma chakuhayama kumesu ami, tahindi? Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Tiyenu, nakaamwina antu ami nikwituŋa dakumusela, nikwituŋa dakumujika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayileta, akashakama muYerusalema, akekala antu ami, ninami nakekala Nzambi yawu, nimunsaŋu yalala, nimukuloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Enu mudi nakutiya mafuku awa mazu awa kutunwa twawatuprofwetu, kufumisha kwifuku daaliluwu chikuku chetala daYehova wamazaza kulonda atuŋi tembeli, koleshenu makasenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hadiŋi mafuku owu achidi kanda, hikwadiŋi chakufweta muntu hela chakufwetela kanyamaku; hikwadiŋi hela kumwena kudi wukwidika hela kudi wukwijila ku, nansaŋu yachilumbu. Muloŋa nazuŋishili antu ejima, iwu nakuzuŋa namukwawu, iwu nakuzuŋa namukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ichi dinu kudi antu awa anashaluku hinukwikala neyi chinadiŋi hakusambilaku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kwakekala mbutu yakumwena; muvinyu wakasoŋa nyikabu yawu, iseki dakahana yakudya yadu, nimawulu akahana wuumi wawu; awa antu anashaluku nakayihetesha yuma yejimiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwamutaŋa waYuda, ninenu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, china chimwadiŋi ishiŋu mukachi kanyuza, dichi nawa nakayamwina, nakayibalumuna kwikala nkisu. Bayi mutiyaloŋa womaku, koleshenu makasenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Munatoŋweli kuyikoŋa chatama hanvulokelaŋawu ankakulula jenu nizuwi, ami nawa kulekamu nchi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Ichi dinu nukulekamu, mafuku awa natoŋoli dehi kukoŋa akwaYerusalema nawakwamutaŋa waYuda chachiwahi. Bayi mutiyaloŋa womaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu yuma yimwakelaŋa. Kahoshenuŋa yalala muntu namukwawu; kasompenuŋa muyota yenu wuŋaji walala wakuwunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu bayi atoŋojokaŋaa mukwawu yatama mumuchima winduku; bayi mukeŋaŋa kusanyika kwakutwambaku. Muloŋa yuma yejimiyi nayihela. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
